<subpara id="X39400000R1018C_12" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___00002SS00000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), read the freeze frame data. Freeze data records part of the engine operating condition when the malfunction occurred, and this information is useful when troubleshooting.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="X39400000R1018C_13" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="X39400000R1018C_13_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___00002ST00000">
<scantool type="4"/>
<testtitle>Read TaSCAN Data (Intake Air Volume)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn the IG ON and, with the engine stopped, read the intake air volume displayed on SST (TaSCAN) after 30 seconds.</ptxt>
<atten3>
<ptxt>Do not extract exhaust from the exhaust tail pipe with an exhaust duct.</ptxt>
</atten3>
<table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
<title>Result:</title>
<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="C01" colwidth="2.68in"/>
<colspec colnum="2" colname="C02" colwidth="1.45in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Approx. 0.0 (g/sec)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>0.39 or more (g/sec)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>More than 0.0 and less than 0.39 (g/sec)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>C</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X39400000R1018C_13_0002" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="X39400000R1018C_13_0013" fin="false">B</right>
<right ref="X39400000R1018C_13_0006" fin="true">C</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
